## Performance Patterns

### Lazy Authentication
- Don't authenticate on page load
- Only authenticate when user performs an action
- Cache authentication state

### Optimistic Updates
- Update UI immediately
- Revert on error
- Show loading states

### Data Aggregation
- Use views for complex queries (`article_like_counts`)
- Combine server-side data before sending to client
- Cache frequently accessed data